        "created_at": "2022-06-17T05:05:37.063Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9348a9831c6fe00820e2330b613ecc98dcd28f02.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/9348a9831c6fe00820e2330b613ecc98dcd28f02\" title=\"Screenshot_20220614-003056\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9348a9831c6fe00820e2330b613ecc98dcd28f02_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220614-003056\" data-base62-sha1=\"l0VRHk2HKjKTrrVOj3C8cukNVlg\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9348a9831c6fe00820e2330b613ecc98dcd28f02_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9348a9831c6fe00820e2330b613ecc98dcd28f02_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9348a9831c6fe00820e2330b613ecc98dcd28f02_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9348a9831c6fe00820e2330b613ecc98dcd28f02_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220614-003056</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 179 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Once I abandoned the idea of keeping ahead of the catastrophes and just embraced the damage race to get Deadline to zero before he destroyed Magmaria, this was pretty straightforward, with all heroes beating on him pretty regularly.</p>",
